heiten.</p>               <lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#g">Kaneel&#x017F;tein</hi>, Kalkthongranat <hi rendition="#aq">C&#x0307;a<hi rendition="#sup">3</hi> S&#x20DB;i + A&#x0336;&#x20DB;l S&#x20DB;i</hi>, 40 <hi rendition="#aq">S&#x20DB;i</hi>, 23 <hi rendition="#aq">A&#x0336;&#x20DB;l</hi>,<lb/>
30,6 <hi rendition="#aq">C&#x0307;a</hi>, 3,7 <hi rendition="#aq">F&#x0336;&#x20DB;e</hi>. Hyacinthroth bis honiggelb, daher der Name (Kaneel<lb/>
<pb n="229" facs="#f0241"/>
