<hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#g">Ei&#x017F;en-Turmalin</hi> = <hi rendition="#aq">F&#x0307;e<hi rendition="#sup">3</hi> S&#x20DB;i<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi> + 6 (A&#x0336;&#x20DB;l</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">F&#x0336;&#x20DB;e) (S&#x20DB;i</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">B&#x20DB;</hi>),</hi><lb/>
