<p><hi rendition="#g">Volborthit</hi><hi rendition="#aq">Bulletin Acad. Imp. St. Petersburg IV. <hi rendition="#sub">2</hi> C&#x0307;u</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">V&#x20DB;</hi> auf<lb/>
