<div n="3">             <head>               <hi rendition="#b">2. Wismuthglanz</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">B&#x0336;<hi rendition="#above-cap">&#x02C8;&#x02C8;&#x02C8;</hi>i.</hi>             </head>             <lb/>
